Module LAPT_0RB1LA_1RC1RD_1LC1LA_1RB0LC.
(** * LAPT_0RB1LA_1RC1RD_1LC1LA_1RB0LC: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 0RB1LA_1RC1RD_1LC1LA_1RB0LC, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

